@@ -257,6 +257,14 @@
             )
             )
 
+            // Change G, porous/free faces: the water Darcy flux itself. The
+            // drift form above (alpha_up*phi + relative flux) rebuilds it
+            // from interpolated alpha and eps; across the alpha and eps
+            // jumps of a porous/free face it gives the wrong phase split
+            // (e.g. water leaving the porous cell while only air enters it).
+            // Zero without porousFreeDarcyFaces (porousFace = Solidf).
